To add the Relaticle MCP server in VS Code, create a `.vscode/mcp.json` file in your project with:

```json
{
  "servers": {
    "relaticle": {
      "type": "streamable-http",
      "url": "https://mcp.relaticle.com",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer YOUR_TOKEN"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Replace `YOUR_TOKEN` with a personal access token from your workspace. ([source](http://relaticle.test/developers/mcp#vs-code-with-a-personal-access-token))

